  "sourceTitle": "Avocado Cucumber Salsa",
  "sourceText": "Avocado Cucumber Salsa\nBy: Matt\nPublished: Thursday, March 2, 2017 - 12:58pm\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\n1 avocado (mashed)\n1 dash black pepper (ground)\n1⁄2 cucumber (grated)\n2 cloves garlic (minced )\n1 lemon (juiced)\n2 small scallion (finely chopped)\n1 dash sea salt\n2 medium tomato (finely chopped)\n\nPreparation\n\n1 Add all the ingredients to a medium size bowl and mix it with a fork.\n\nAbout\n\nThis Avocado Cucumber Salsa tastes so good that it will become your favourite appetiser in no time.",
